   "body": "Fixes #4952\n\nIn a `Field` wrapping a `CheckboxGroup`, all checkboxes share one validation instance but each merges its hidden input into a single shared ref, so only the last-mounted input was ever checked. With multiple `required` checkboxes, ticking any one of them cleared the field's error even while the others were still empty.\n\n## Root cause\n\nField validation read native validity from a single representative input, so the group looked valid as soon as one of several `required` checkboxes was ticked.\n\n## Changes\n\n- Track every input registered against a field, and when more than one shares it, validate against a currently-invalid one so each `required` checkbox is enforced independently (matching native per-checkbox behavior).",
